sequenceDiagram
    actor Approver
    participant Frontend
    participant Server
    participant Database
    
    Approver->>Frontend: Buka Inbox Dokumen
    Frontend->>Server: GET /api/inbox (Filter by Role)
    Server->>Database: Query dokumen_transaksi (current_assignee_role_id)
    Database-->>Server: List Dokumen
    Server-->>Frontend: Tampilkan Daftar Dokumen
    
    Approver->>Frontend: Klik Dokumen & Lihat Lampiran PDF
    Approver->>Frontend: Pilih aksi (APPROVE / REJECT)
    
    alt Jika REJECT
        Approver->>Frontend: Wajib isi "Catatan Revisi"
        Frontend->>Server: POST /api/dokumen/reject
        Server->>Database: UPDATE dokumen_transaksi (status: NEED_REVISION, step mundur)
        Server->>Database: INSERT INTO log_aktivitas (aksi: REJECT, catatan)
    else Jika APPROVE
        Frontend->>Server: POST /api/dokumen/approve
        Server->>Database: UPDATE dokumen_transaksi (step maju, opsional: COMPLETED)
        Server->>Database: INSERT INTO log_aktivitas (aksi: APPROVE)
    end
    Database-->>Server: Success
    Server-->>Frontend: Status Dokumen Diperbarui
